<Layout title="About · Foresight Labs" description="About Foresight Labs, an independent product studio."><section class="page-intro container"><p class="eyebrow">The studio</p><h1>Software with a little more <em>thought.</em></h1><p>Foresight Labs is an independent product studio creating thoughtful, privacy-conscious and intelligently designed digital applications.</p></section><section class="section"><div class="container split-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">Why we exist</p><h2>Complexity is not a badge of honour.</h2></div><div><p>We believe the best technology is often the technology that helps people feel more capable, not more managed. Our products combine practical tools, refined interfaces and responsible artificial intelligence to make everyday information easier to live with.</p><p class="trust-note">Foresight Labs is not described as a registered company or corporation. It is an independent product studio, building in public with care.</p></div></div></section><section class="section section-tint"><div class="container studio-lede"><p class="eyebrow">A note on the work</p><h2>In development is a promise to keep thinking.</h2><p>Our products are still taking shape. We will share real availability, links and policies as they become ready. Until then, the most useful thing we can offer is a clear sense of what we are trying to make.</p></div></section></Layout>
